/// <li><a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qmetaobject.html#enumerator" translate="no">enumerator</a>() and <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qmetaobject.html#enumeratorCount" translate="no">enumeratorCount</a>() and provide information about a class's enumerators.</li>
