/// <li><a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qlatin1stringview.html" translate="no">QLatin1StringView</a>: if you can implement the function without converting the <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qlatin1stringview.html" translate="no">QLatin1StringView</a> to UTF-16 first; users expect a function overloaded on <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qlatin1stringview.html" translate="no">QLatin1StringView</a> to perform strictly less memory allocations than the semantically equivalent call of the QStringView version, involving construction of a <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qstring.html" translate="no">QString</a> from the <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qlatin1stringview.html" translate="no">QLatin1StringView</a>.</li>
