/// <p>These character types are internally decomposed into a UTF-16 sequence (using <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qchar.html#fromUcs4" translate="no">QChar::fromUcs4</a>() for the last).</p>
/// <h4 id="sizes-and-sub-strings">Sizes and Sub-Strings</h4>
