/// <p>QTextStream can operate on a <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qiodevice.html" translate="no">QIODevice</a>, a <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qbytearray.html" translate="no">QByteArray</a> or a <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qstring.html" translate="no">QString</a>. Using QTextStream's streaming operators, you can conveniently read and write words, lines and numbers. For generating text, QTextStream supports formatting options for field padding and alignment, and formatting of numbers. Example:</p>
///
