/// <p>Calling <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qurl.html#isRelative" translate="no">isRelative</a>() will return whether or not the URL is relative. A relative URL has no <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qurl.html#scheme" translate="no">scheme</a>. For example:</p>
