/// <p>This class can be used to hold one of the many types available in CBOR. CBOR is the Concise Binary Object Representation, a very compact form of binary data encoding that is a superset of JSON. It was created by the IETF Constrained RESTful Environments (CoRE) WG, which has used it in many new RFCs. It is meant to be used alongside the <a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7252">CoAP protocol</a>.</p>
