/// <p>This class can be used to quickly encode a stream of CBOR content directly to either a <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qbytearray.html" translate="no">QByteArray</a> or <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qiodevice.html" translate="no">QIODevice</a>. CBOR is the Concise Binary Object Representation, a very compact form of binary data encoding that is compatible with JSON. It was created by the IETF Constrained RESTful Environments (CoRE) WG, which has used it in many new RFCs. It is meant to be used alongside the <a href="https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7252">CoAP protocol</a>.</p>
///
/// C++ class: <span style='color: green;'>```QCborStreamWriter```</span>.
