/// <p>QMimeData objects are usually created using <code translate="no">new</code> and supplied to <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qdrag.html" translate="no">QDrag</a> or <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qclipboard.html" translate="no">QClipboard</a> objects. This is to enable Qt to manage the memory that they use.</p>
