/// <p>Determining the MIME type of a file can be useful to make sure your application supports it. It is also useful in file-manager-like applications or widgets, in order to display an appropriate <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qmimetype.html#iconName-prop" translate="no">icon</a> for the file, or even the descriptive <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qmimetype.html#comment-prop" translate="no">comment</a> in detailed views.</p>
