/// <p>A QResource can either be loaded with an absolute path, either treated as a file system rooted with a <code translate="no">/</code> character, or in resource notation rooted with a <code translate="no">:</code> character. A relative resource can also be opened which will be found in the list of paths returned by <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qdir.html#searchPaths" translate="no">QDir::searchPaths</a>().</p>
