/// <p>QTextBoundaryFinder allows to find Unicode text boundaries in a string, accordingly to the Unicode text boundary specification (see <a href="https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr14/">Unicode Standard Annex #14</a> and <a href="https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr29/">Unicode Standard Annex #29</a>).</p>
