/// <p>QWaitCondition allows a thread to tell other threads that some sort of condition has been met. One or many threads can block waiting for a QWaitCondition to set a condition with <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qwaitcondition.html#wakeOne" translate="no">wakeOne</a>() or <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qwaitcondition.html#wakeAll" translate="no">wakeAll</a>(). Use <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qwaitcondition.html#wakeOne" translate="no">wakeOne</a>() to wake one randomly selected thread or <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qwaitcondition.html#wakeAll" translate="no">wakeAll</a>() to wake them all.</p>
///
/// C++ class: <span style='color: green;'>```QWaitCondition```</span>.
