/// <p>Items can be removed from the hash in several ways. One way is to call <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qhash.html#remove" translate="no">remove</a>(); this will remove any item with the given key. Another way is to use <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qmutablehashiterator.html#remove" translate="no">QMutableHashIterator::remove</a>(). In addition, you can clear the entire hash using <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qhash.html#clear" translate="no">clear</a>().</p>
